the move place with a row and a col is legal at a time if
    the row is a row
    and the col is a col
    and it is not the case that the row cell the col with red at the time
    and it is not the case that the row cell the col with black at the time.

the goal of red is 100 at a time if
    redpath at the time.

the goal of red is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that redpath at the time.

the goal of black is 100 at a time if
    blackpath at the time.

the goal of black is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that blackpath at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    redpath at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    blackpath at the time.

redpath at a time if
    a thing connected "a" with a col at the time
    and the thing connected g with a second col at the time
    and the thing is the owner of red at the time.

blackpath at a time if
    a thing connected a row with 1 at the time
    and the thing connected a second row with 7 at the time
    and the thing is the owner of black at the time.

when the move cleanup with a thing is made
    and the thing connected a row with a col
then it is not the case that the thing connected the row with the col.

when the move cleanup with a thing is made
    and a second thing is a step
    and the thing connected a row with a col
then the second thing connected the row with the col.

when the move place with a row and a col is made
    and a role is a control
    and a thing is a step
then the row cell the col with the role
    and the thing is the owner of the role
    and the thing connected the row with the col.

when the move place with a row and a col is made
    and a thing connected a second row with a second col
    and the thing connected a third row with a third col
    and a role is a control
    and the row adjacent the col with the third row with the third col
    and the third row cell the third col with the role
then it is not the case that the thing connected the second row with the second col.

when the move place with a row and a col is made
    and a thing is a step
    and a second thing connected a second row with a second col
    and the second thing connected a third row with a third col
    and a role is a control
    and the row adjacent the col with the third row with the third col
    and the third row cell the third col with the role
then the thing connected the second row with the second col.

when the move place with a row and a col is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

when the move place with a row and a col is made
    and red is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move place with a row and a col is made
    and black is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

when the move transfer with a row and a col is made
    and a thing connected a second row with a second col
    and the thing connected the row with the col
then it is not the case that the thing connected the second row with the second col.

when the move transfer with a row and a col is made
    and a thing is a step
    and a second thing connected a second row with a second col
    and the second thing connected the row with the col
then the thing connected the second row with the second col.

when the move update with a row and a col is made
    and a thing is a step
then the thing connected the row with the col.

it must not be true that
    the move place with a row and a col is made
    and it is not the case that the move place with the row and the col is legal.

initially 1 is a step
    and red is a control.

